  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 9
  storyText: "The sky is clear blue again \u2014 beautiful, like the world is mocking
    us. The fat orange cat is back to its old habits, waddling around the courtyard,
    trying to mess with the ducks. The ducks are not impressed. They hiss. The cat
    backs off. Then tries again. Same dance, every day. At least someone's having
    fun. We're just sitting here, scrolling through social media, sending messages
    to anyone we know. Friends. Classmates. That one guy from group project we never
    really liked. No replies. Or worse \u2014 replies from family members saying
    they haven't heard from them either. We're not sure which is worse: silence or
    confirmation.\r"
